---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "@codebakkers/ui/components/Container.astro";
import Prose from "@codebakkers/ui/components/Prose.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Faith — Henk Bakker"
  description="A little about my faith in Jesus, and my church community."
>
  <Container narrow>
    <section>
      <p class="kicker">FAITH</p>
      <h1>Following Jesus</h1>
      <Prose>
        <p>
          Alongside the engineering, the most important thing about me is that I follow Jesus. My
          faith isn't a side interest — it shapes how I try to live, work, and treat the people
          around me.
        </p>
        <p>
          I believe the good news is exactly that: good news, and it's for everyone. That people can
          know the love and the rescuing power of Jesus for themselves. It's something I care about
          enough to want to share, gently and honestly, with anyone who's curious.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          "For I am not ashamed of the gospel, because it is the power of God that brings salvation
          to everyone who believes." — Romans 1:16
        </blockquote>

        <h2>My church — Farmhouse Church</h2>
        <p>
          I'm part of <a href="https://defarmhouse.nl">Farmhouse Church</a>, a New Testament church
          in Garsthuizen, Groningen, committed to the Great Commission and to serving people across
          the region — young and old alike.
        </p>
        <p>
          We gather every Sunday morning at 9:30 (Smydingheweg 46, Garsthuizen). If you'd like to
          come along, or just want to talk about any of this, you're genuinely welcome — reach out
          any time.
        </p>
        <p><a class="btn" href="https://defarmhouse.nl">Visit Farmhouse Church →</a></p>
      </Prose>
    </section>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  section {
    margin: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-12);
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-strong);
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
